msgid "Welcome to Wingastock!"
msgstr "Karibu Wingastock!"

msgid "Wingastock is an online marketplace that makes it easy to discover, advertise, buy and sell a wide range of products and services. You can find electronics such as smartphones, laptops, TVs, computers and accessories, as well as furniture, home appliances, rooms, houses and many other products from sellers on the platform."
msgstr "Wingastock ni soko la mtandaoni linalorahisisha kugundua, kutangaza, kununua na kuuza bidhaa na huduma mbalimbali. Unaweza kupata vifaa vya elektroniki kama simu janja, laptop, televisheni, kompyuta na vifaa vyake, pamoja na samani, vifaa vya nyumbani, vyumba, nyumba na bidhaa nyingine nyingi kutoka kwa wauzaji waliopo kwenye jukwaa."

msgid "Whether you are looking to buy something or want to advertise and sell your products, the following guide explains how to use Wingastock:"
msgstr "Iwe unatafuta kununua kitu au unataka kutangaza na kuuza bidhaa zako, mwongozo ufuatao unaeleza jinsi ya kutumia Wingastock:"

msgid "Create an Account:"
msgstr "Fungua Akaunti:"

msgid "Register for a Wingastock account using your required personal or business information. Make sure the information you provide is accurate and up to date."
msgstr "Jisajili kwa akaunti ya Wingastock kwa kutumia taarifa zako binafsi au za biashara zinazohitajika. Hakikisha taarifa unazotoa ni sahihi na zimesasishwa."

msgid "Complete Your Profile:"
msgstr "Kamilisha Wasifu Wako:"

msgid "After creating your account, complete your profile with the relevant information. A complete profile helps other users know who they are dealing with and makes communication easier."
msgstr "Baada ya kufungua akaunti yako, kamilisha wasifu wako kwa taarifa zinazohitajika. Wasifu kamili huwasaidia watumiaji wengine kujua wanayeshughulika naye na hurahisisha mawasiliano."

