msgid "How to Contact a Seller on Wingastock"
msgstr "Jinsi ya Kuwasiliana na Muuzaji kwenye Wingastock"

msgid "Wingastock makes it easy for customers to communicate directly with sellers before making a purchase. To protect users and provide a better marketplace experience, customers must have a registered Wingastock account before they can access seller contact information or send messages to sellers."
msgstr "Wingastock inarahisisha wateja kuwasiliana moja kwa moja na wauzaji kabla ya kufanya ununuzi. Ili kuwalinda watumiaji na kutoa uzoefu bora wa soko, wateja lazima wawe na akaunti ya Wingastock iliyosajiliwa kabla ya kupata taarifa za mawasiliano ya muuzaji au kutuma ujumbe kwa wauzaji."

msgid "Create a Wingastock Account:"
msgstr "Fungua Akaunti ya Wingastock:"

msgid "If you do not already have an account, register on Wingastock using your required information. Registration is required before you can access seller contact details or use the platform's messaging features."
msgstr "Ikiwa bado huna akaunti, jisajili kwenye Wingastock kwa kutumia taarifa zinazohitajika. Usajili unahitajika kabla ya kupata maelezo ya mawasiliano ya muuzaji au kutumia huduma za ujumbe za jukwaa."

msgid "Log In to Your Account:"
msgstr "Ingia kwenye Akaunti Yako:"

msgid "After registration, log in to your Wingastock account. Once you are logged in, you can interact with sellers and access the communication features available on product listings."
msgstr "Baada ya usajili, ingia kwenye akaunti yako ya Wingastock. Baada ya kuingia, unaweza kuwasiliana na wauzaji na kutumia huduma za mawasiliano zinazopatikana kwenye matangazo ya bidhaa."

msgid "Find the Product You Want:"
msgstr "Tafuta Bidhaa Unayotaka:"

msgid "Search or browse Wingastock to find the product you are interested in. You can explore categories such as smartphones, laptops, TVs, computers, accessories, furniture, home appliances, rooms, houses and other products."
msgstr "Tafuta au vinjari Wingastock ili kupata bidhaa unayoipenda. Unaweza kuchunguza kategoria kama simu janja, laptop, televisheni, kompyuta, vifaa vyake, samani, vifaa vya nyumbani, vyumba, nyumba na bidhaa nyingine."

msgid "Open the Product Listing:"
msgstr "Fungua Tangazo la Bidhaa:"

msgid "Click on the product you are interested in to view its details, including the description, price, images, availability and seller information."
msgstr "Bonyeza bidhaa unayoipenda ili kuona maelezo yake, ikiwemo maelezo ya bidhaa, bei, picha, upatikanaji na taarifa za muuzaji."

msgid "View Seller Contact Information:"
msgstr "Angalia Taarifa za Mawasiliano ya Muuzaji:"

msgid "If the seller has provided contact information that is available to registered customers, you can view the available seller contact details after logging into your Wingastock account."
msgstr "Ikiwa muuzaji ametoa taarifa za mawasiliano zinazopatikana kwa wateja waliosajiliwa, unaweza kuona maelezo hayo baada ya kuingia kwenye akaunti yako ya Wingastock."

msgid "Send a Direct Message:"
msgstr "Tuma Ujumbe wa Moja kwa Moja:"

msgid "You can also communicate with the seller directly through Wingastock's integrated chat system. Select the available chat or message option on the product or seller page to start a conversation."
msgstr "Unaweza pia kuwasiliana moja kwa moja na muuzaji kupitia mfumo wa mazungumzo wa Wingastock. Chagua chaguo la mazungumzo au ujumbe kwenye ukurasa wa bidhaa au muuzaji ili kuanza mazungumzo."

msgid "Ask Questions Before Buying:"
msgstr "Uliza Maswali Kabla ya Kununua:"

msgid "Use the chat system to ask the seller about product availability, condition, specifications, price, location, delivery or any other information you need before making a purchase."
msgstr "Tumia mfumo wa mazungumzo kumuuliza muuzaji kuhusu upatikanaji wa bidhaa, hali yake, sifa zake, bei, mahali ilipo, uwasilishaji au taarifa nyingine yoyote unayohitaji kabla ya kufanya ununuzi."

msgid "Keep Your Conversations in Wingastock:"
msgstr "Weka Mazungumzo Yako ndani ya Wingastock:"

msgid "Where possible, use Wingastock's integrated chat system to communicate with sellers. Keeping conversations within the platform can make it easier to manage your enquiries and refer back to previous conversations."
msgstr "Inapowezekana, tumia mfumo wa mazungumzo wa Wingastock kuwasiliana na wauzaji. Kuweka mazungumzo ndani ya jukwaa kunaweza kurahisisha kusimamia maswali yako na kurejea mazungumzo ya awali."

msgid "Be Careful With Personal Information:"
msgstr "Kuwa Makini na Taarifa Binafsi:"

msgid "Do not share unnecessary passwords, account credentials, financial information or other sensitive personal information through chat. Only provide information that is necessary for completing a legitimate transaction."
msgstr "Usishiriki nywila zisizo za lazima, taarifa za kuingia kwenye akaunti, taarifa za kifedha au taarifa nyingine nyeti binafsi kupitia mazungumzo. Toa tu taarifa zinazohitajika kukamilisha muamala halali."

msgid "Report Suspicious Activity:"
msgstr "Ripoti Shughuli za Kutiliwa Shaka:"

msgid "If a seller sends suspicious messages, provides misleading information, attempts to scam you or violates Wingastock policies, report the activity through the appropriate Wingastock support or reporting channel."
msgstr "Ikiwa muuzaji anatuma ujumbe wa kutiliwa shaka, anatoa taarifa za kupotosha, anajaribu kukulaghai au anakiuka sera za Wingastock, ripoti shughuli hiyo kupitia njia husika ya msaada au kuripoti ya Wingastock."

msgid "Why Registration Is Required:"
msgstr "Kwa Nini Usajili Unahitajika:"

msgid "Requiring customers to register before accessing seller contacts and messaging helps Wingastock maintain a safer and more trusted marketplace. It allows users to have an identifiable account, provides access to the platform's communication features and helps reduce misuse of seller contact information."
msgstr "Kuwataka wateja wajisajili kabla ya kupata mawasiliano ya wauzaji na huduma za ujumbe husaidia Wingastock kudumisha soko salama na linaloaminika zaidi. Huwapa watumiaji akaunti inayotambulika, huwapa uwezo wa kutumia huduma za mawasiliano za jukwaa na husaidia kupunguza matumizi mabaya ya taarifa za mawasiliano ya wauzaji."

