msgid "Important:"
msgstr "Muhimu:"

msgid "Seller contact information and communication options may depend on the information provided by the seller and the features available for the particular listing. Always use Wingastock responsibly and follow the platform's applicable terms, privacy rules and safety guidelines."
msgstr "Taarifa za mawasiliano ya muuzaji na chaguo za mawasiliano zinaweza kutegemea taarifa zilizotolewa na muuzaji na huduma zinazopatikana kwenye tangazo husika. Tumia Wingastock kwa uwajibikaji na fuata masharti, kanuni za faragha na miongozo ya usalama inayotumika kwenye jukwaa."

msgid "How to Register as a Seller on Wingastock"
msgstr "Jinsi ya Kujisajili kama Muuzaji kwenye Wingastock"

msgid "Becoming a seller on Wingastock allows you to advertise and sell your products to customers through our online marketplace. Follow the steps below carefully to create your seller account."
msgstr "Kuwa muuzaji kwenye Wingastock kunakuwezesha kutangaza na kuuza bidhaa zako kwa wateja kupitia soko letu la mtandaoni. Fuata hatua zilizo hapa chini kwa makini ili kufungua akaunti yako ya muuzaji."

msgid "Read the Seller Terms and Conditions:"
msgstr "Soma Masharti na Vigezo vya Wauzaji:"

msgid "Before starting the seller registration process, carefully read and understand the Wingastock Seller Terms and Conditions. These terms explain your responsibilities as a seller, including product listings, customer service, payments, prohibited products and compliance with applicable laws."
msgstr "Kabla ya kuanza mchakato wa usajili wa muuzaji, soma na uelewe kwa makini Masharti na Vigezo vya Wauzaji vya Wingastock. Masharti haya yanaeleza majukumu yako kama muuzaji, ikiwa ni pamoja na matangazo ya bidhaa, huduma kwa wateja, malipo, bidhaa zilizopigwa marufuku na kufuata sheria zinazotumika."

msgid "Start Seller Registration:"
msgstr "Anza Usajili wa Muuzaji:"

msgid "Select the option to register or become a seller on Wingastock and begin the seller registration process."
msgstr "Chagua chaguo la kujisajili au kuwa muuzaji kwenye Wingastock na anza mchakato wa usajili wa muuzaji."

msgid "Fill in Your Seller Information:"
msgstr "Jaza Taarifa Zako za Muuzaji:"

msgid "Provide the required seller information accurately and completely. Depending on the information requested by Wingastock, this may include your name, business information, contact details and other information required to create and manage your seller account."
msgstr "Toa taarifa zinazohitajika za muuzaji kwa usahihi na ukamilifu. Kulingana na taarifa zinazoombwa na Wingastock, hizi zinaweza kujumuisha jina lako, taarifa za biashara, maelezo ya mawasiliano na taarifa nyingine zinazohitajika kufungua na kusimamia akaunti yako ya muuzaji."

msgid "Review Your Information:"
msgstr "Kagua Taarifa Zako:"

msgid "Before continuing, carefully check all the information you have entered. Make sure your details are correct because this information may be used to manage your seller account and communicate with you."
msgstr "Kabla ya kuendelea, kagua kwa makini taarifa zote ulizoingiza. Hakikisha taarifa zako ni sahihi kwa sababu zinaweza kutumika kusimamia akaunti yako ya muuzaji na kuwasiliana nawe."

msgid "Complete the Seller Declaration:"
msgstr "Kamilisha Tamko la Muuzaji:"

msgid "Read the seller declaration carefully and confirm that the information you have provided is accurate and that you agree to the applicable Seller Terms and Conditions."
msgstr "Soma tamko la muuzaji kwa makini na uthibitishe kuwa taarifa ulizotoa ni sahihi na kwamba unakubaliana na Masharti na Vigezo vya Wauzaji vinavyotumika."

msgid "Receive Your @winga.com Seller Email:"
msgstr "Pokea Barua Pepe Yako ya Muuzaji ya @winga.com:"

msgid "During the declaration or account-creation process, Wingastock will provide you with a dedicated"
msgstr "Wakati wa mchakato wa tamko au kufungua akaunti, Wingastock itakupatia"

msgid "email address for your seller account."
msgstr "barua pepe maalum kwa ajili ya akaunti yako ya muuzaji."

msgid "Save this email address carefully."
msgstr "Hifadhi barua pepe hii kwa uangalifu."

msgid "This email is important because it is used specifically for your seller login and for accessing your seller account."
msgstr "Barua pepe hii ni muhimu kwa sababu inatumika mahsusi kuingia kwenye akaunti yako ya muuzaji na kupata akaunti yako ya muuzaji."

msgid "Create Your Account Password:"
msgstr "Tengeneza Nenosiri la Akaunti Yako:"

msgid "Enter and confirm a secure password for your seller account. Choose a password that is difficult for others to guess and do not share it with anyone."
msgstr "Weka na uthibitishe nenosiri salama kwa ajili ya akaunti yako ya muuzaji. Chagua nenosiri ambalo ni vigumu kwa wengine kulikisia na usimshirikishe mtu yeyote."

msgid "Submit Your Seller Registration:"
msgstr "Wasilisha Usajili Wako wa Muuzaji:"

msgid "After completing all required information, reviewing the terms and declaration, receiving your"
msgstr "Baada ya kukamilisha taarifa zote zinazohitajika, kukagua masharti na tamko, kupokea"

msgid "seller email and creating your password, submit the registration form."
msgstr "barua pepe yako ya muuzaji na kutengeneza nenosiri lako, wasilisha fomu ya usajili."

msgid "Keep Your Seller Login Details Safe:"
msgstr "Linda Taarifa Zako za Kuingia kama Muuzaji:"

msgid "Your"
msgstr "Barua pepe yako ya"

msgid "seller email and password are your seller account login credentials. Keep them secure and do not share them with other people."
msgstr "ya muuzaji na nenosiri lako ni taarifa za kuingia kwenye akaunti yako ya muuzaji. Zilinde na usizishirikishe na watu wengine."

msgid "Log In to Your Seller Account:"
msgstr "Ingia kwenye Akaunti Yako ya Muuzaji:"

msgid "After successful registration, use your assigned"
msgstr "Baada ya usajili kufanikiwa, tumia"

msgid "seller email and account password to log in and access your seller account."
msgstr "barua pepe ya muuzaji na nenosiri la akaunti yako kuingia na kupata akaunti yako ya muuzaji."

msgid "Start Selling on Wingastock:"
msgstr "Anza Kuuza kwenye Wingastock:"

msgid "Once you have access to your seller account, you can use the available seller features to create product listings, add product information, manage your products, communicate with customers and manage your selling activities."
msgstr "Baada ya kupata akaunti yako ya muuzaji, unaweza kutumia huduma zinazopatikana kwa wauzaji kutengeneza matangazo ya bidhaa, kuongeza taarifa za bidhaa, kusimamia bidhaa zako, kuwasiliana na wateja na kusimamia shughuli zako za mauzo."

msgid "Your"
msgstr "Barua pepe yako ya"

msgid "seller email is specifically used for seller account login and access. Make sure you save it somewhere safe immediately after it is provided to you. If you lose your seller login details, use the available Wingastock account recovery or support process."
msgstr "ya muuzaji inatumika mahsusi kuingia na kupata akaunti ya muuzaji. Hakikisha unaihifadhi mahali salama mara tu unapopewa. Ukipoteza taarifa zako za kuingia kama muuzaji, tumia mchakato unaopatikana wa kurejesha akaunti au kupata msaada kutoka Wingastock."

